sbook><name>YOSHIDA, TOMOKAZU</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SANO YOSHINARI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>UEDA YASUHISA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YOSHIDA TOMOKAZU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SANO, YOSHINARI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>UEDA, YASUHISA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOSHIDA, TOMOKAZU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A wiper for machine tool small in abrasion resistance and abrasion loss at a lip part, comprising a mounting part (3) installed on a machine tool moving relative to a sliding surface (14) and a wiper main body (10) which is formed integrally with the mounting part (3) and made of an elastic material, wherein a lip part (11) of the wiper main body (10) can be slid on the sliding surface (14), and at least the lip part (11) of the wiper main body (10) is covered with fabric material (5), whereby the wiper for machine tool is prevented from being damaged by the collision or impact of chips and the sliding surfaces thereof is prevented from being damaged.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un dispositif essuyeur pour machine-outil présentant, à une partie de lèvre, une faible résistance à l'abrasion et de faibles pertes dues à l'abrasion. Le dispositif comporte un élément de fixation (3) installé sur une machine-outil mobile par rapport à une surface de glissement, et un corps principal (10) de dispositif essuyeur formant une seule pièce avec l'élément de fixation (3) et constitué d'une matière élastique. Une partie de lèvre (11) du corps principal (10) de dispositif essuyeur peut être glissée sur la surface de glissement (14), et au moins la partie de lèvre (11) du corps principal (10) de dispositif essuyeur est recouverte d'une matière textile (5). Le dispositif essuyeur pour machine-outil et ses surfaces de glissement sont protégés contre des détériorations dues au contact ou au choc de fragments.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>